### command_line_arguments

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ arguments_from (index : i32) : list string =\n    ?= try_command_line_argument index ?|\n    | None => []\n    | Some argument => argument :: arguments_from (index + 1i32)\n\n:= command_line_arguments () : list string = arguments_from 0i32\n\n:= head_is_first_argument (head : string) : bool =\n    ?= try_command_line_argument 0i32 ?|\n    | Some a => a = head\n    | None => !-\n\n:= first_argument_matches (listed : list string) : bool =\n    ?= listed ?|\n    | head :: _ => head_is_first_argument head\n    | [] => command_line_argument_count () = 0i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ arguments_from (index : i32) : list string =
      ?= try_command_line_argument index ?|
      | None => []
      | Some argument => argument :: arguments_from (index + 1i32)

  := command_line_arguments () : list string = arguments_from 0i32

  := head_is_first_argument (head : string) : bool =
      ?= try_command_line_argument 0i32 ?|
      | Some a => a = head
      | None => !-

  := first_argument_matches (listed : list string) : bool =
      ?= listed ?|
      | head :: _ => head_is_first_argument head
      | [] => command_line_argument_count () = 0i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

