### command_line_arguments_from

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ command_line_arguments_back (first : i32) (at : i32) (arguments : list string) : list string =\n    ? at < first ?> arguments\n    |: command_line_arguments_back first (at - 1i32) (command_line_argument at :: arguments)\n\n:~ command_line_arguments_from (index : i32) : list string =\n    command_line_arguments_back (? index < 0i32 ?> 0i32 |: index) (command_line_argument_count () - 1i32) []\n\n:= argument_count_from (index : i32) : i32 = listm::length (command_line_arguments_from index)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ command_line_arguments_back (first : i32) (at : i32) (arguments : list string) : list string =
      ? at < first ?> arguments
      |: command_line_arguments_back first (at - 1i32) (command_line_argument at :: arguments)

  :~ command_line_arguments_from (index : i32) : list string =
      command_line_arguments_back (? index < 0i32 ?> 0i32 |: index) (command_line_argument_count () - 1i32) []

  := argument_count_from (index : i32) : i32 = listm::length (command_line_arguments_from index)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

