#### an_environment_snapshot_restores_to_itself (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n\n:= before = environment_snapshot ()\n(sm'::length before > 0i32, restored_to_itself before, \"PATH2\" |> get_environment_variable)\n|> _assert_eq (!+, !+, \"\")","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
